# Forms (default — never remove)

All forms use **one customized, unified** system. No bare browser defaults mixed into product UI.

## Required controls

| Control | Requirement |
|---------|-------------|
| Label | Tied to control; required marker consistent |
| Text / textbox | Shared height, radius, border, focus |
| Email | Same chrome + email validation UX |
| Tel | Same chrome; optional shared formatting |
| Password | **Show / hide** toggle; same chrome as text |
| Search | Clear action when value present |
| Select | Custom select matching input metrics |
| Checkbox | Custom box + full label hit target |
| Picker | Date/time — same tokens as inputs |
| Stepper | − / value / + with min, max, step |
| Editor | Multiline / rich — shared focus/error |
| Upload | Photo/file — preview, remove, type/size errors |
| Button | Primary / secondary / ghost; **with** and **without** icon |
| Link `a` | Brand link tokens; not default browser blue |

## Styling (locked with forms)

- One token set: height, radius, border, focus ring, error, success, disabled, placeholder
- Consistent error message placement and tone
- Keyboard + screen-reader accessible
- Shared `components/ui/` (or equivalent) — no one-off page skins
- Icon-only buttons need `aria-label` (or visible text)

See also: `ui-styling.mdc`, `validation.mdc`. Advanced: `forms-advanced.mdc`.
